's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"ujM10t6IRJGA2I5mYpd8XQ","review_id":"janYQl1aQofj-LO9DHUmEA","date":"2018-01-09T20:26:00","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9362242221832275,"text_excerpt":"Loving it!! Since Mona's closed I've kept an eye on this spot. The last occupant was a miss, but this ones a winner! Something we need more of: local, authentic, quick, inexpensive and delicious restaurants. El Taco Loco checks all the boxes. It's setup like other fast service taco/burrito joints with options including Quesadilla's, Taco Salad, Nachos, Tamales and Wings. Where they surpass is in the meat choices which include Lenga, Tinga and Chorizo in addition to the regular chicken, beef, pork and veggie options. The meats are DELICIOUS! Well seasoned and cooked. I loved the house made guacamole. What I love most, the value, it's all completely reasonable. I had the Lenga & Carnitas ta..."},{"business_id":"ujM10t6IRJGA2I5mYpd8XQ","review_id":"b8a3wfWgFpWoQ-dB5sg5Vg","date":"2019-01-22T01:32:44","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9319148063659668,"text_excerpt":"The best. I happen to work close to this place, which is both a good thing and a bad thing. My coworkers and I are always stopping by for lunch. Every single thing I've had here is good. I've had the taco salad (my favorite), burritos, chimichangas, nachos, tamales, and wings. My favorite meat is the al pastor but they've recently added steak so that may be changing. There's an array of toppings to choose from: fresh guacamole, queso, beans, cilantro, Mexican crema, etc. The staff is always friendly and very quick to get your food to you. The margaritas are SUPER good and strong. If alcohol is not your thing (or you have to go back to work), grab one of the Jarrito's sodas. They also do p..."},{"business_id":"ujM10t6IRJGA2I5mYpd8XQ","review_id":"ZWRiP_Wvy6-wpHc9Q0E9tw","date":"2019-06-19T06:58:05","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.926082968711853,"text_excerpt":"I was craving tacos for taco Tuesday for once and found this place on Eater NOLA's list of recommended taco places. I wasn't aware they did $1 off their regular taco prices on Tuesdays but glad to know now! I ordered 2 chicken tacos, 2 of their special pork tacos (taco loco), a chicken tamale, and a mango soda all for about $13. Really flavorful meat and the best tamales I've had so far. Service was nice and prompt. I'll definitely be returning."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ujM10t6IRJGA2I5mYpd8XQ","photo_id":"JF_ILEUmyvdv9VqNyYEmXg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/JF_ILEUmyvdv9VqNyYEmXg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8589073419570923},{"business_id":"ujM10t6IRJGA2I5mYpd8XQ","photo_id":"r9S5xxUlwykF_J9LxVv50w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/r9S5xxUlwykF_J9LxVv50w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8534390330314636},{"business_id":"ujM10t6IRJGA2I5mYpd8XQ","photo_id":"rzNpAK-BjCHxdzqDRyp-RA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/rzNpAK-BjCHxdzqDRyp-RA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8078165054321289},{"business_id":"ujM10t6IRJGA2I5mYpd8XQ","photo_id":"ByJ1n_l0Yo-AwAOHGRC9wA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ByJ1n_l0Yo-AwAOHGRC9wA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7764322757720947},{"business_id":"ujM10t6IRJGA2I5mYpd8XQ","photo_id":"STk8YULahZePGFOoHw43mQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/STk8YULahZePGFOoHw43mQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.742721438407898}]},"notebook_case":null}
